{"server":"tw","storyId":"act3d0_ui_act3d0_campselect","groupId":"act3d0","stageId":"a003_st01","title":"演出開始","storyCode":"ENTRY","avgTag":"幕間","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act3d0/ui_act3d0_campselect.txt","sourceHash":"72baa2c83ced24aa71b49366f301074f7d9f25e7a4ea163faf208918e90c45dc","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第一关（前）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"ac3_title1"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_Festival_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主持人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"歡迎你們來到一年一度的汐斯塔黑曜石節！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主持人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"汐斯塔！讓我聽到你們的聲音！！"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"觀眾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（狂熱的歡呼聲）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主持人","speakerId":"avg_npc_017_3","isRemote":false,"text":"無論你是什麼種族，從哪個城市來，從今天開始，拋棄自己的身份，忘掉所有的煩惱！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主持人","speakerId":"avg_npc_017_3","isRemote":false,"text":"黑曜石節日需要的是每一個人的參與！！融入！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主持人","speakerId":"avg_npc_017_3","isRemote":false,"text":"把你們每個人的手都舉到最高，讓我能看到你們每一個人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"觀眾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（狂熱的歡呼聲）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主持人","speakerId":"avg_npc_017_3","isRemote":false,"text":"老規矩，今年我們也會選出我們黑曜石節的最受歡迎藝人！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主持人","speakerId":"avg_npc_017_3","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，在狂歡之餘，也別忘了給自己最喜歡的音樂藝人進行<color=#ee4321>投票</color>。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主持人","speakerId":"avg_npc_017_3","isRemote":false,"text":"注意！你<color=#ee4321>只有一次機會</color>做出選擇，選擇的結果將不會有機會做變更。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主持人","speakerId":"avg_npc_017_3","isRemote":false,"text":"但是也請不要擔心，投票結果的高低都<color=#ee4321>不會影響</color>大家獲得的獎勵！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主持人","speakerId":"avg_npc_017_3","isRemote":false,"text":"只要你做出了選擇並<color=#ee4321>完成了所有里程碑任務</color>，你將獲得相應的里程碑獎勵！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"觀眾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"噢噢噢噢噢噢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主持人","speakerId":"avg_npc_017_3","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，請不要猶豫，為你最喜歡的藝人投上寶貴的一票吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主持人","speakerId":"avg_npc_017_3","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼接下來，做出你的選擇！！告訴我，你最愛的音樂藝人到底在哪裡！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
